      "label": "hostile emotion",
      "description": "The man's stern, confrontational facial expression, combined with his grip on the assault rifle, conveys a clear sense of hostility and aggression toward the implied target (illegal immigrants). His gaze is direct and intense, suggesting anger or threat.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
